  "body": "Bags are packed, and the vendors are ready for their next journey, creating an outstanding opportunity for the next owners to secure a home that offers so much more than meets the eye.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern living, this well-appointed single-level home combines space, flexibility, and a range of extras rarely found together.\r\n\r\n• Solar panels with battery storage for greater energy efficiency\r\n• Two ensuites plus a third family bathroom\r\n• Private spa retreat for relaxing and unwinding\r\n• Four generous bedrooms\r\n• Flexible layout ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers or working from home\r\n• Covered outdoor entertaining area with pull-down side blinds\r\n• Enjoy outdoor living comfortably throughout the seasons\r\n• Beautifully landscaped gardens and private outdoor spaces\r\n• Easy-care, single-level living\r\n• Sought-after Sunny Heights location, close to Orewa amenities, schools and beaches\r\n\r\nFrom the solar power system and rare dual-ensuite layout to the sheltered outdoor entertaining area and private spa retreat, this home offers far more than the standard four-bedroom package. Every detail has been carefully considered to create a lifestyle of comfort, practicality and ease.\r\n\r\nWith motivated vendors ready to make their move, this is your chance to secure a home that's truly not your average four-bedroom home.",
